# oracle: angle_style cross (YAFF) on the mol_chains angles, other terms harmonic, pair zero. 40 steps: the run leaves native's trajectory after step 44 (one near-planar improper, chi 0.13 deg, where native's cos-based force loses digits; the cross forces alone agree with native to 5e-14 at that geometry, measured)
# measured 2026-10-13 (engine vs native, max relative error per value, no absolute floor): thermo 2.3e-13, per-atom 3.5e-11; the compare passes at rel 1e-8 abs 1e-10.
# oracle-inputs: mol_chains.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           lj
atom_style      molecular
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     cross
dihedral_style  harmonic
improper_style  harmonic
pair_style      zero 2.5
read_data       mol_chains.data
pair_coeff      * *
bond_coeff      1 120.0 1.05
bond_coeff      2 90.0 1.1
angle_coeff     1 200.0 100.0 100.0 1.25 1.25 107.0
angle_coeff     2 150.0 80.0 60.0 1.0 1.2 120.0
dihedral_coeff  1 1.5 -1 3
improper_coeff  1 12.0 20.0
special_bonds   lj 0.0 0.5 0.8
variable        vx atom 0.1*sin(1.3*x+0.7*y)
variable        vy atom 0.1*cos(0.9*y-0.4*z)
variable        vz atom 0.1*sin(1.1*z+0.5*x)
velocity        all set v_vx v_vy v_vz
velocity        all zero linear
timestep        0.002
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ebond eangle edihed eimp evdwl etotal press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g norm no
thermo          10
run             40
